This project contains code derived from Physical Intelligence's openpi project:
https://github.com/Physical-Intelligence/openpi

Upstream source snapshot: the main branch retrieved on 2026-07-10.

The derived client/server transport, BasePolicy interface, NumPy MessagePack
codec, and image utilities are used under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The files have been modified for UAV remote inference, including protocol
envelopes, reset messages, request IDs, deadlines, bounded message sizes,
structured errors, and client-side safety handling.

